			"Message": "chore(build): Update Queue submodule\n\nUpdate the Queue dependency submodule to commit e70ec39. This dependency is critical for managing asynchronous operations and IPC message queuing between Mountain's core and Cocoon's extension host. Keeping dependencies current ensures we leverage latest stability improvements and performance optimizations in the queuing layer, which directly impacts extension host communication reliability and overall editor responsiveness.\n\nMaintains compatibility with planned Vine IPC enhancements for bi-directional RPC streams between Rust backend and Node.js shim processes.",
			"SHA": "62cddee69217bcab475aae642f9e51cbb41a162d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-20T18:15:44Z",
