				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(contributing): normalize URL protocols to lowercase\n\n- Updated all HTTPS protocol references in CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md and CONTRIBUTING.md to use lowercase 'https://'\n- Maintains consistency with modern URL formatting standards and markdown best practices\n- Improves document readability while keeping all external references functionally identical\n- Aligns with project's emphasis on attention to detail in both code and documentation aspects\n- No impact on application functionality or architecture components like Mountain/Cocoon",
